<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Investors cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Investors cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Friday it had cut its rating for First Investors Financial Services Group Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The Houston company's shares opened off 3/4 to a 12-month low of 7-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
